    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6508db30fec2bfa8f48acae43c674b0d.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a crash landing, you awake stranded and lacking abilities or memory. However, a mysterious voice named Root calls out, offering helpful guidance. But be warned, this strange planet is full of killer robots and dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/58c2d6459bf77784a5d352b0913f68ca.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/58c2d6459bf77784a5d352b0913f68ca.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/58c2d6459bf77784a5d352b0913f68ca.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/10beb0a25749d928e17b0be3067d0767.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially limited to rolling based movement, you will soon acquire new abilities and weapons allowing access to more areas, eventually uncovering the world\u2019s many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/8351cd1d6bc54fd270c1ad1ff8fee864.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/8351cd1d6bc54fd270c1ad1ff8fee864.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/8351cd1d6bc54fd270c1ad1ff8fee864.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/c227adfdedee8536b67ca431381214b0.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The engaging story is delivered as a continuous experience without any pauses or overwhelming players with excessive reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/620007ba005207ea541ee9adddaccd22.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/620007ba005207ea541ee9adddaccd22.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/620007ba005207ea541ee9adddaccd22.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/08f42db0250ba5796a0a810ad6b4ab24.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired pixel art is elevated with dynamic lights and shadows to create a unique visual style. Procedural algorithms give an organic feel to the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/e5541a1a5dfbd11ebe8a373c800dc47f.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/e5541a1a5dfbd11ebe8a373c800dc47f.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/e5541a1a5dfbd11ebe8a373c800dc47f.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/672446f1dd90fe2a9e06d970fa0c3c61.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer's passion project, Piroot is not just a game, it's a labor of love. The custom engine is also open source and includes a level editor, so players can create and share their own stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6ef3edcba2b10c7828b97d98cfb418a4.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6ef3edcba2b10c7828b97d98cfb418a4.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6ef3edcba2b10c7828b97d98cfb418a4.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/3db334e74c33a1951a572e297d2be9e5.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure like no other in Piroot, where boundaries are shattered and the secrets of an entire planet are yours to discover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Piroot is in Early Access! Features include...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First chapter of the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6508db30fec2bfa8f48acae43c674b0d.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a crash landing, you awake stranded and lacking abilities or memory. However, a mysterious voice named Root calls out, offering helpful guidance. But be warned, this strange planet is full of killer robots and dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/58c2d6459bf77784a5d352b0913f68ca.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/58c2d6459bf77784a5d352b0913f68ca.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/58c2d6459bf77784a5d352b0913f68ca.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/10beb0a25749d928e17b0be3067d0767.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially limited to rolling based movement, you will soon acquire new abilities and weapons allowing access to more areas, eventually uncovering the world\u2019s many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/8351cd1d6bc54fd270c1ad1ff8fee864.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/8351cd1d6bc54fd270c1ad1ff8fee864.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/8351cd1d6bc54fd270c1ad1ff8fee864.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/c227adfdedee8536b67ca431381214b0.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The engaging story is delivered as a continuous experience without any pauses or overwhelming players with excessive reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/620007ba005207ea541ee9adddaccd22.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/620007ba005207ea541ee9adddaccd22.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/620007ba005207ea541ee9adddaccd22.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/08f42db0250ba5796a0a810ad6b4ab24.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired pixel art is elevated with dynamic lights and shadows to create a unique visual style. Procedural algorithms give an organic feel to the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/e5541a1a5dfbd11ebe8a373c800dc47f.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/e5541a1a5dfbd11ebe8a373c800dc47f.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/e5541a1a5dfbd11ebe8a373c800dc47f.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/672446f1dd90fe2a9e06d970fa0c3c61.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer's passion project, Piroot is not just a game, it's a labor of love. The custom engine is also open source and includes a level editor, so players can create and share their own stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6ef3edcba2b10c7828b97d98cfb418a4.poster.avif?t=1752011769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6ef3edcba2b10c7828b97d98cfb418a4.webm?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/6ef3edcba2b10c7828b97d98cfb418a4.mp4?t=1752011769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523510/extras/3db334e74c33a1951a572e297d2be9e5.avif?t=1752011769\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure like no other in Piroot, where boundaries are shattered and the secrets of an entire planet are yours to discover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Piroot is in Early Access! Features include...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First chapter of the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
